# Uvagf · 02 · Nyy dhvrg, 8599 gvzrf

## Uvag 1

Gnxr gur rknzcyr sebz gur ERNQZR naq n crapvy. Tb guebhtu gur vachg 1 yvar ng n gvzr naq, nsgre
rnpu yvar, jevgr qbja 2 guvatf: jung lbh unir jevggra gb gur bhgchg fb sne, naq jung lbh fgvyy
arrq gb erzrzore. Jura qbrf n znexre orpbzr xabja? Abg jura gur eha fgnegf, naq abg va gur zvqqyr
bs vg. Sbe `PbhagZrffntrf`, abgvpr gung vg nfxf sbe 2 guvatf ng bapr: n snfg jnl gb svaq "unir V
frra guvf zrffntr orsber?", naq na beqre. Juvpu Tb glcr tvirf lbh rnpu bs gurz?

## Uvag 2

N znexre pna bayl or jevggra jura vgf eha unf raqrq. N eha raqf va 2 jnlf: n yvar jvgu n qvssrerag
zrffntr neevirf, be gur vachg raqf. Gur ybbc obql frrf gur svefg pnfr. Abguvat va gur ybbc frrf gur
frpbaq bar, fb gur eha ng gur raq bs gur vachg arrqf pbqr nsgre gur ybbc. Gung vf gur pynffvp oht
bs guvf xvaq bs ybbc: rirel grfg cnffrf hagvy gur ynfg yvar vf cneg bs n eha.

Lbh qb abg arrq n inevnoyr sbe gur cerivbhf yvar: vafvqr `sbe v, yvar := enatr yvarf`, gur
cerivbhf yvar vf `yvarf[v-1]`, nf ybat nf `v > 0`.

Sbe `PbhagZrffntrf`: n znc ybfrf gur beqre, naq n fyvpr nybar znxrf rirel ybbxhc n ybbc. Hfr obgu.
Yrg gur znc ubyq gur cbfvgvba bs gur zrffntr va gur fyvpr. Qb abg fgber n cbvagre gb n fyvpr
ryrzrag va gur znc: jura `nccraq` arrqf zber ebbz, vg pbcvrf gur ryrzragf gb n arj neenl, naq
lbhe cbvagre fgvyy cbvagf ng gur byq bar.

## Uvag 3

Na bhgyvar:

1. `Zrffntr`: `fgevatf.Phg(yvar, " ")` ergheaf gur cneg orsber gur svefg fcnpr, gur cneg nsgre
   vg, naq jurgure vg sbhaq n fcnpr. Jvgubhg n fcnpr, erghea gur yvar.
2. N fznyy urycre gung ergheaf gur gvzrfgnzc bs n yvar (rzcgl jura gurer vf ab fcnpr), naq n
   urycre gung ohvyqf gur znexre sebz gur ynfg yvar bs n eha naq A. Hfr `fgepbai.Vgbn` sbe A, naq
   cvpx `gvzr` be `gvzrf`.
3. `Pbyyncfr`: na bhgchg fyvpr naq n pbhagre bs ercrngf va gur pheerag eha. Sbe rnpu yvar: vs vg vf
   abg gur svefg yvar naq vgf zrffntr rdhnyf gur zrffntr bs gur cerivbhf yvar, pbhag vg naq tb ba
   gb gur arkg yvar. Bgurejvfr, vs gur pbhagre vf nobir 0, nccraq gur znexre sbe gur cerivbhf yvar
   naq erfrg gur pbhagre; gura nccraq gur yvar.
4. Nsgre gur ybbc, vs gur pbhagre vf nobir 0, nccraq gur znexre sbe gur ynfg yvar.
5. `PbhagZrffntrf`: n `[]Pbhag` naq n `znc[fgevat]vag` sebz zrffntr gb vaqrk. Sbe rnpu yvar, ybbx
   gur zrffntr hc. Sbhaq: nqq 1 gb `A` bs gung ryrzrag. Abg sbhaq: fgber gur vaqrk `yra(pbhagf)`,
   gura nccraq n arj `Pbhag` jvgu `A` 1.
